14
01:27:12.740 --> 01:27:19.330
Percival, Katarzyna Bromirska, Joanna Lacher, Krystyna Bogdanowa,

15
01:27:19.330 --> 01:27:29.570
Mikołaj Rybacki, Wioletta Hodowicz, Brodka, Chór Pro Musica Mundi,

16
01:27:30.250 --> 01:27:32.250
